# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# Intentionally no mountable partitions for the first compile-only target.
# This does not make upstream TWRP read-only: startup and UI actions still
# require a separate audit before any authorized device test.
#
# Stock normal userdata is F2FS, not ext4, and requires inlinecrypt,
# fileencryption=aes-256-xts:aes-256-cts:v2+inlinecrypt_optimized+wrappedkey_v0,
# metadata_encryption=aes-256-xts:wrappedkey_v0, and
# keydirectory=/metadata/vold/metadata_encryption.
# No /data, /metadata, /misc, /persist, firmware or raw flash target is admitted.
